{"claim_id": "7b6eb026849a665c", "section_id": "finding_1", "text": "A skill description determines when the model considers the skill and clear descriptions improve triggering reliability.", "claim_type": "factual", "cited_source_ids": ["2b9a3c911443ff1a", "1057fa2031f4b4f3", "5a76c2d18403e338"], "evidence_ids": ["98607f4372df5f7a", "c50363ab025716f2", "92c7922eb6e7f9eb"], "support_status": "supported", "extracted_at": "2026-07-27T18:35:08.316980+00:00", "_support_score": 0.818, "_support_notes": "adequate overlap"}
{"claim_id": "ffdd0a133ca1eb32", "section_id": "finding_1", "text": "Skills can degrade agent performance when they trigger incorrectly, conflict with other skills, or contain poor instructions.", "claim_type": "factual", "cited_source_ids": ["552d8d922110cfc8", "2b9a3c911443ff1a", "5a76c2d18403e338"], "evidence_ids": ["132ca2d31c11598c", "98607f4372df5f7a", "92c7922eb6e7f9eb"], "support_status": "supported", "extracted_at": "2026-07-27T18:35:08.358279+00:00", "_support_score": 0.943, "_support_notes": "adequate overlap"}
{"claim_id": "daae6dd6769e8e66", "section_id": "finding_2", "text": "Agents load skills progressively and pull in more detail only when a task requires it.", "claim_type": "factual", "cited_source_ids": ["f36ae4007ec3a8cf", "1057fa2031f4b4f3", "ee885bfc4c773cf4"], "evidence_ids": ["4a46daef1be408ea", "c50363ab025716f2", "e336a2063ba630ff"], "support_status": "supported", "extracted_at": "2026-07-27T18:35:08.398739+00:00", "_support_score": 0.891, "_support_notes": "adequate overlap"}
{"claim_id": "a596a5601ceeafed", "section_id": "finding_2", "text": "Context is finite and performance can degrade when relevant information moves within a long context.", "claim_type": "factual", "cited_source_ids": ["126e07cf0d684e03", "9dbf664b6954efbc", "f36ae4007ec3a8cf"], "evidence_ids": ["e7d60785181a2b06", "c652233d235c5b26", "4a46daef1be408ea"], "support_status": "supported", "extracted_at": "2026-07-27T18:35:08.442559+00:00", "_support_score": 0.68, "_support_notes": "low lexical overlap"}
{"claim_id": "9e44442e387c09e0", "section_id": "finding_3", "text": "Clear tool interfaces describe and enforce expected inputs and outputs while procedural action traces help update plans and handle exceptions.", "claim_type": "factual", "cited_source_ids": ["1399aec680791f78", "e504ba1ba9c3fffc", "ffc229d83891918f"], "evidence_ids": ["4fd7d645c6bcf31e", "558324da246daa0a", "50e2a9a5685b3b17"], "support_status": "partial", "extracted_at": "2026-07-27T18:35:08.483357+00:00", "_support_score": 0.565, "_support_notes": "entity mismatch"}
{"claim_id": "f9f2b22cfe077e13", "section_id": "finding_4", "text": "Good skills are concise, well structured, tested with real usage, and use deterministic helpers only when complexity improves outcomes.", "claim_type": "synthesis", "cited_source_ids": ["ee885bfc4c773cf4", "2b9a3c911443ff1a", "ffc229d83891918f"], "evidence_ids": ["e336a2063ba630ff", "98607f4372df5f7a", "50e2a9a5685b3b17"], "support_status": "supported", "extracted_at": "2026-07-27T18:35:08.525530+00:00", "_support_score": 0.625, "_support_notes": "entity mismatch"}
{"claim_id": "67805c8479b70749", "section_id": "finding_5", "text": "Because model outputs vary between runs, agent evaluations require multiple trials to produce more consistent results.", "claim_type": "factual", "cited_source_ids": ["6c790a16de0afd2b", "8e7c3fdead65d71e", "5a76c2d18403e338"], "evidence_ids": ["503ab38bee16aadd", "5f55916f787e5c52", "92c7922eb6e7f9eb"], "support_status": "supported", "extracted_at": "2026-07-27T18:35:08.564317+00:00", "_support_score": 0.92, "_support_notes": "adequate overlap"}
{"claim_id": "bcbd0e119c697693", "section_id": "finding_5", "text": "Agent benchmarks identify long-term reasoning, decision-making, instruction following, and tool-use consistency as important evaluation targets.", "claim_type": "synthesis", "cited_source_ids": ["d4fa18e119ff6d1b", "8e7c3fdead65d71e", "6c790a16de0afd2b"], "evidence_ids": ["802dbb510d5a586f", "5f55916f787e5c52", "503ab38bee16aadd"], "support_status": "partial", "extracted_at": "2026-07-27T18:35:08.604073+00:00", "_support_score": 0.587, "_support_notes": "entity mismatch"}
{"claim_id": "82d463836b189205", "section_id": "finding_6", "text": "Skill security requires trusted sources, constrained impact, adaptive evaluation, and explicit user consent for tool invocation.", "claim_type": "synthesis", "cited_source_ids": ["5388df5d34815380", "3dec299964e674ad", "5acce7f97d5fe1dc", "b392e88a73117f1d"], "evidence_ids": ["2db1e1d0e31ddf67", "eb1f5d687d381a3a", "b53bada9072166d3", "f2a28c210e3a3230"], "support_status": "partial", "extracted_at": "2026-07-27T18:35:08.643801+00:00", "_support_score": 0.514, "_support_notes": "low lexical overlap; entity mismatch"}
{"claim_id": "5b3a9207773d6340", "section_id": "finding_6", "text": "Large-scale red teaming found successful agent hijacking attacks against every target model, supporting layered security rather than perfect-detection claims.", "claim_type": "factual", "cited_source_ids": ["f0501b761a7a2f3f", "981b7447e975049e", "bd6a126919a0eae3"], "evidence_ids": ["27c89bd1288fd546", "6d02a303294384b7", "dffb56183e9f8538"], "support_status": "partial", "extracted_at": "2026-07-27T18:35:08.683255+00:00", "_support_score": 0.5, "_support_notes": "low lexical overlap; entity mismatch"}
{"claim_id": "6e561e6f973ef741", "section_id": "synthesis", "text": "The evidence supports minimum sufficient intervention: add skill complexity only when representative evaluation demonstrates improved outcomes.", "claim_type": "synthesis", "cited_source_ids": ["2e50ab69ebea3b2c", "ffc229d83891918f", "6c790a16de0afd2b"], "evidence_ids": ["2cb56fa07ca0d372", "50e2a9a5685b3b17", "503ab38bee16aadd"], "support_status": "supported", "extracted_at": "2026-07-27T18:35:08.724049+00:00", "_support_score": 0.714, "_support_notes": "low lexical overlap"}
{"claim_id": "26d495b407e5f6d1", "section_id": "recommendations", "text": "Production skill releases should require trigger, outcome, coexistence, repeated-trial, and adversarial security gates.", "claim_type": "recommendation", "cited_source_ids": ["552d8d922110cfc8", "6c790a16de0afd2b", "981b7447e975049e"], "evidence_ids": ["132ca2d31c11598c", "503ab38bee16aadd", "6d02a303294384b7"], "support_status": "partial", "extracted_at": "2026-07-27T18:35:08.762001+00:00", "_support_score": 0.431, "_support_notes": "low lexical overlap; entity mismatch"}
